<title>USA: New York physical copper market - May 13.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - May 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for May shipment were quoted at a nominal 115.95 to 116.20 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 95.00 cents, up 2.00 cents from May 12th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
